WEBVTT

00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:23.886
Why? Somehow you seem upset
Why? Nandaka ochikon deru mitai

00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:32.262
Voice, my voice. I want it to reach you
Voice, my voice. Todoketai yo kimini

00:00:32.902 --> 00:00:40.902
Things aren't going the way you'd like
Omoi douri ni naranai koto nara

00:00:41.277 --> 00:00:49.277
That might happen a lot now, but...
Ima wa takusan attarisuru kedo

00:00:51.654 --> 00:00:56.182
Tomorrow, another new wind
Mata ashita wa chigau kaze

00:00:56.593 --> 00:00:59.688
will blow your way
fuite kuruyo

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:04.695
Spread your arms and let your chest
Ryoute wo hirogeta mune ni

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:08.029
just feel the breeze
kanjiru mama

00:01:08.338 --> 00:01:12.832
No matter what befalls us,
Nani ga osoi kakattemo

00:01:13.209 --> 00:01:16.201
no matter how difficult it may be
semetatete mo

00:01:16.946 --> 00:01:23.443
We'll be all right
Watashi tachi wa daijyoubu

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:41.061
Every special memory is
associated with a scent.

00:01:42.038 --> 00:01:43.904
When you are surrounded by that scent...

00:01:44.407 --> 00:01:49.038
...your heart can always return
to that unforgettable moment...

00:01:51.081 --> 00:01:56.019
...where the colors of the picture
that you see are forever bright.

00:02:01.057 --> 00:02:06.223
A Smile to the Tearful Angel

00:02:06.396 --> 00:02:12.096
Otowanomori Nishi High School

00:02:21.478 --> 00:02:23.879
Saori Haruta, first year, class three.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.276
Her father is a movie producer.

00:02:28.718 --> 00:02:29.378
Hey!

00:02:31.888 --> 00:02:32.821
Thanks!

00:02:33.857 --> 00:02:35.757
Kenjo, you know...

00:02:36.759 --> 00:02:39.421
What? Oh, it's Kanzaki and Nitta...

00:02:42.031 --> 00:02:44.500
They seem like they're doing good.

00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:46.768
Kanzaki has eccentric taste.

00:02:47.036 --> 00:02:49.300
What does he see in that barbarian?

00:02:53.576 --> 00:02:54.839
Something in his hair?

00:02:55.645 --> 00:02:57.443
Women will be women.

00:03:27.377 --> 00:03:28.640
Hey, Ma-kun.

00:03:29.646 --> 00:03:31.910
Don't you think it's getting to be a problem?

00:03:32.048 --> 00:03:32.981
What?

00:03:33.216 --> 00:03:34.012
That.

00:03:46.729 --> 00:03:48.390
Here you go. Thanks.

00:03:52.702 --> 00:03:54.796
Life is so unfair.

00:03:54.938 --> 00:03:57.771
It'd be nice if something good
would happen to me too.

00:03:58.541 --> 00:04:01.806
Hey, are you listening God? Jeez...

00:04:04.981 --> 00:04:07.848
There it is! Thank you, God!

00:04:10.787 --> 00:04:12.277
Whoa!

00:04:14.591 --> 00:04:16.389
Nice!

00:04:28.538 --> 00:04:30.973
Ishizuka General Hospital

00:04:34.911 --> 00:04:37.608
You only fractured your right leg.

00:04:37.947 --> 00:04:39.608
You're a lucky guy.

00:04:39.949 --> 00:04:42.941
No, I'm not. My important data...

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.586
You'll be in the hospital for four or five days.

00:04:46.122 --> 00:04:47.419
Is there anything you want?

00:04:47.824 --> 00:04:48.848
Not really...

00:04:49.225 --> 00:04:53.560
Okay. I have to take care of some
insurance things, so I'll be going.

00:04:53.796 --> 00:04:55.161
Thanks for the effort.

00:04:58.768 --> 00:05:02.636
I'll go crazy if I have to stay
here for four or five days.

00:05:06.142 --> 00:05:08.440
Something so important and she forgot it.

00:05:08.678 --> 00:05:10.510
| still might be able to catch her.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.101
I'm starting to feel faint...

00:05:36.572 --> 00:05:38.802
| can't anymore...

00:05:45.381 --> 00:05:47.907
Hey! What are you doing here?

00:05:49.052 --> 00:05:49.746
Huh?

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.981
She smells good...

00:05:58.294 --> 00:06:01.696
Mr. Kurumizawa, you shouldn't
be moving around yet!

00:06:02.198 --> 00:06:03.757
What are you going to
do if it gets infected?

00:06:04.033 --> 00:06:06.058
Y-Yes! I'm sorry.

00:06:11.941 --> 00:06:13.431
{ wonder what this scent is?

00:06:13.843 --> 00:06:16.938
It's not perfume. It smells warm and sweet...

00:06:19.549 --> 00:06:21.860
She's cute... On top of that...

00:06:21.884 --> 00:06:23.249
They're pretty big.

00:06:23.953 --> 00:06:24.818
What is it?

00:06:25.922 --> 00:06:27.447
N-No, nothing!

00:06:28.224 --> 00:06:29.783
Oh, this nametag?

00:06:30.393 --> 00:06:32.521
All the interns are required to wear one.

00:06:32.829 --> 00:06:35.298
Oh... Oh really?

00:06:37.467 --> 00:06:38.377
Takano...

00:06:40.002 --> 00:06:41.197
Mizuki...

00:06:41.804 --> 00:06:42.737
Lisa.

00:06:43.139 --> 00:06:45.972
Mizuki... So her name is Mizuki Takano.

00:06:46.776 --> 00:06:47.709
Good evening!

00:06:48.411 --> 00:06:50.004
Good evening.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.178
Why are you holding a frying pan?

00:06:52.281 --> 00:06:55.444
Well, you know...

00:06:56.252 --> 00:06:57.048
Strange.

00:06:57.687 --> 00:07:01.419
That's right! Lisa, the pink
pansies were in bloom.

00:07:02.291 --> 00:07:03.053
Really?

00:07:03.126 --> 00:07:08.155
Yup. But, it's late already, so let's
go see them together tomorrow.

00:07:08.464 --> 00:07:10.262
Okay. Definitely!

00:07:12.034 --> 00:07:15.026
She had a serious Kidney disease.

00:07:16.172 --> 00:07:19.938
They operated on her last month
and she's in rehab right now.

00:07:20.943 --> 00:07:25.278
Her parents both work, so she's always alone.

00:07:26.182 --> 00:07:29.311
That's why I play with her during my breaks.

00:07:29.919 --> 00:07:32.251
Even though she's not one
of my department's patients.

00:07:32.989 --> 00:07:33.854
| see...

00:07:34.424 --> 00:07:35.823
She's so nice...

00:07:39.762 --> 00:07:42.307
That should do it. Don't move again!

00:07:42.331 --> 00:07:43.162
Okay.

00:07:43.499 --> 00:07:44.762
Take care.

00:07:53.609 --> 00:07:56.408
Hi Grandma. It's spring isn't it?

00:07:59.282 --> 00:08:01.717
Let's see. I've gotta get moving.

00:08:01.818 --> 00:08:03.718
At times like this, I need...

00:08:07.323 --> 00:08:09.917
It's 9 o'clock, time to turn out the lights.

00:08:10.293 --> 00:08:12.762
Please turn off your lights,
and have a good night.

00:08:25.308 --> 00:08:26.139
Hello?

00:08:27.143 --> 00:08:27.905
Makoto?

00:08:28.244 --> 00:08:30.736
What? I thought you were in the hospital.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:34.159
Wow, you sound really sleepy.

00:08:34.183 --> 00:08:35.461
<i>Of course I am.</i>

00:08:35.485 --> 00:08:36.953
What time do you think it is?

00:08:37.253 --> 00:08:40.223
What time? It's only a little past nine.

00:08:40.456 --> 00:08:42.117
Don't tell me you were sleeping?

00:08:42.558 --> 00:08:43.320
| was.

00:08:45.795 --> 00:08:47.456
Well, I'm going to bed if it's nothing.

00:08:48.364 --> 00:08:49.923
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:08:53.636 --> 00:08:54.313
"That"?

00:08:54.337 --> 00:08:57.500
Yeah! I want you to go to my
house, get it and bring it to me.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.303
What's “that"?

00:08:59.609 --> 00:09:01.407
There's only one thing
| mean when I say "that"!

00:09:01.544 --> 00:09:03.188
{ don't know what “that" is.

00:09:03.212 --> 00:09:04.509
Like I just said...

00:09:05.615 --> 00:09:06.639
Kenjo, listen to me!

00:09:06.816 --> 00:09:12.277
| want you to go get Dr. Kirara Mitsuboshi's
Love Manual. The Love Manual!

00:09:13.389 --> 00:09:16.415
Okay? You got it?
I'm counting on you Kenjo!

00:09:19.161 --> 00:09:20.322
Made it just in time.

00:09:25.034 --> 00:09:27.503
Manual
Sendai

00:09:28.704 --> 00:09:30.297
What's that face for?

00:09:30.406 --> 00:09:32.170
Where's my "thank you"?

00:09:32.742 --> 00:09:36.440
| went all the way to your house
after school to go get it.

00:09:36.846 --> 00:09:39.543
Thanks, but this isn't it.

00:09:39.682 --> 00:09:42.982
It's not? That's what you said
over the phone yesterday.

00:09:43.286 --> 00:09:44.879
Something Sendai Manual.

00:09:45.354 --> 00:09:50.349
| said love manual! Dr. Kirara
Mitsuboshi's Love Manual.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.905
| always show it to you at school.

00:09:52.929 --> 00:09:55.125
Oh, you wanted that!

00:09:55.464 --> 00:10:01.233
Why would I want to research Sendai
tourist spots at the hospital?!

00:10:01.504 --> 00:10:04.474
You were whispering so I couldn't hear you.

00:10:04.941 --> 00:10:06.875
| was going to make sure,
but you hung up on me.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:10.280
Stop blaming it on me! Go back and get it.

00:10:10.613 --> 00:10:13.605
No way. If you want it,
ask your mom to bring it.

00:10:14.383 --> 00:10:17.683
| asked you because I can't ask my mom!

00:10:18.087 --> 00:10:19.452
Hey, Kurumizawa!

00:10:20.389 --> 00:10:21.720
What's all the noise?

00:10:22.592 --> 00:10:24.356
Nothing, we were just...

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:27.261
I've brought magazines because
| thought you might be bored.

00:10:27.396 --> 00:10:29.490
Oh, he brought you a book.

00:10:30.266 --> 00:10:32.667
Oh, I don't care about this.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:38.868
This isn't really for guys, but
| thought it might Kill some time.

00:10:40.643 --> 00:10:42.133
Thank you, Mizuki.

00:10:43.613 --> 00:10:46.275
She's hot. Her name is Mizuki?

00:10:46.949 --> 00:10:49.884
Go home, Kenjo. I don't need you anymore.

00:10:50.186 --> 00:10:53.053
You bastard. I'll make that
fracture into a broken leg!

00:10:53.289 --> 00:10:55.087
She called me by my name.

00:10:56.492 --> 00:11:00.759
She called me Kurumizawa and
she brought me a magazine.

00:11:02.098 --> 00:11:06.035
There's no doubt about it. Mizuki likes me!

00:11:06.135 --> 00:11:07.899
Ow!

00:11:20.683 --> 00:11:21.616
A boyfriend?

00:11:21.717 --> 00:11:23.762
She has to have one!

00:11:23.786 --> 00:11:25.276
No, she doesn't.

00:11:25.955 --> 00:11:28.083
No, look how hot she is.

00:11:28.391 --> 00:11:29.756
It'd be strange if she didn't have one.

00:11:41.671 --> 00:11:46.006
Really? So she doesn't have a boyfriend?

00:11:46.242 --> 00:11:48.587
Yeah, she said she has no
time to find a boyfriend.

00:11:48.611 --> 00:11:50.773
| knew it. She doesn't have one.

00:11:51.614 --> 00:11:52.979
| told you, Kenjo.

00:11:53.349 --> 00:11:55.078
"It'd be strange if she didn't
have one", whatever.

00:11:56.886 --> 00:11:57.512
He's gone.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:02.886
Makoto, look. Isn't this pink pansy cute?

00:12:02.992 --> 00:12:05.154
What do girls like?

00:12:06.796 --> 00:12:10.494
What do girls like? I want to know.

00:12:11.967 --> 00:12:13.958
Something girls like?

00:12:22.144 --> 00:12:23.873
Miss Takano.

00:12:26.649 --> 00:12:27.775
Oh, hello.

00:12:28.517 --> 00:12:29.245
What's wrong?

00:12:29.919 --> 00:12:30.715
Well...

00:12:31.554 --> 00:12:32.316
What?

00:12:33.255 --> 00:12:36.020
| have a present for you.

00:12:37.426 --> 00:12:39.622
From Makoto Kurumizawa with love.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:41.558
Here.

00:12:47.303 --> 00:12:47.946
Huh?

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:48.246
What's going on?
Huh?

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:48.702
What's going on?

00:12:48.904 --> 00:12:49.393
What was that?

00:12:54.643 --> 00:12:55.821
Uh... um!

00:12:55.845 --> 00:12:57.335
What's going on, Miss Takano?

00:12:57.913 --> 00:12:58.471
Head nurse!

00:12:58.748 --> 00:13:02.627
What are you doing? A nurse shouldn't
raise her voice! This is a hospital!

00:13:02.651 --> 00:13:04.085
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.248
An apology isn't going to do! Come with me!

00:13:08.924 --> 00:13:09.652
Yes...

00:13:15.364 --> 00:13:16.263
W-Why?

00:13:23.572 --> 00:13:25.062
It's so cute.

00:13:25.841 --> 00:13:31.302
Wait a minute, Lisa. So you're the
one who likes frogs, and Mizuki...

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:34.445
MizuKi hates frogs.

00:13:34.784 --> 00:13:37.219
She said she doesn't understand
how people could like them.

00:13:38.387 --> 00:13:39.513
That sucks...

00:13:39.889 --> 00:13:43.519
Hey, Makoto. You like Mizuki, don't you?

00:13:45.094 --> 00:13:52.091
| like her? It's more
like she likes me, so...

00:13:52.768 --> 00:13:54.463
I doubt it.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.363
You're a blunt Kid.

00:13:56.772 --> 00:13:57.534
Hold on a minute.

00:13:58.274 --> 00:14:00.208
What's your sign?

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.609
I'm an Aries.

00:14:02.845 --> 00:14:05.780
An Aries. Got it, hold on.

00:14:17.893 --> 00:14:20.726
Your lucky color today is red...

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:25.597
If you wear this, you'll probably be
able to become friends with Mizuki.

00:14:26.302 --> 00:14:27.701
Friends...

00:14:31.974 --> 00:14:33.464
Um, about earlier...

00:14:52.094 --> 00:14:54.426
She completely hates me.

00:14:55.731 --> 00:14:56.664
Hey, Makoto!

00:14:57.466 --> 00:14:58.610
Came to see you.

00:14:58.634 --> 00:14:59.601
You alive?

00:15:05.641 --> 00:15:06.233
<i>See ya.</i>

00:15:06.942 --> 00:15:07.636
Bye.

00:15:12.748 --> 00:15:15.809
| had to see the two people
| didn't want to see right now...

00:15:16.352 --> 00:15:17.148
Makoto.

00:15:18.354 --> 00:15:20.345
What's wrong? You look down.

00:15:22.157 --> 00:15:22.953
Night shift?

00:15:23.259 --> 00:15:28.373
Yup. Mizuki has the night shift
for a while, starting today.

00:15:28.397 --> 00:15:31.423
| see, so that's why I didn't
see her during the day...

00:15:31.901 --> 00:15:33.835
It's okay, Makoto.

00:15:35.337 --> 00:15:38.864
Mizuki's not mad about the frog anymore.

00:15:39.041 --> 00:15:40.285
| doubt it...

00:15:40.309 --> 00:15:43.540
You're such a downer. Cheer up!

00:15:43.946 --> 00:15:44.674
Sure.

00:16:02.364 --> 00:16:04.924
What are you doing?

00:16:05.234 --> 00:16:08.568
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:16:10.005 --> 00:16:13.407
You screamed. You dropped
expensive equipment...

00:16:13.676 --> 00:16:15.838
It's proof you're not paying attention!

00:16:16.245 --> 00:16:18.441
I'll apologize to Dr. Kasai for you.

00:16:19.081 --> 00:16:20.125
I'm sorry.

00:16:20.149 --> 00:16:23.119
Mizuki, you need to take
responsibility for your job.

00:16:23.385 --> 00:16:25.911
At this rate, you're never going
to become a full-fledged nurse.

00:16:26.622 --> 00:16:27.589
I'm so sorry.

00:16:34.964 --> 00:16:36.159
Ding-Dong.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.462
Do you want coffee or oolong tea?

00:16:48.744 --> 00:16:53.341
When I was young, I spent a lot of time
in the hosptial because I was sick.

00:16:54.249 --> 00:16:56.877
It was my first time being in
a hospital and I was so lonely.

00:16:57.753 --> 00:17:03.658
My parents couldn't really
come visit me often...

00:17:04.093 --> 00:17:08.929
When the nurses realized that,
they came to see me when they could.

00:17:10.132 --> 00:17:14.535
They were like, "How are you?"
"You can do it." It made me so happy.

00:17:15.037 --> 00:17:19.338
Thanks to that, I was able to recover
faster and leave the hospital early.

00:17:20.075 --> 00:17:22.420
That's when I thought "I'm going
to be a wonderful nurse too."

00:17:22.444 --> 00:17:24.776
| get it. So that's why with Lisa, you're...

00:17:27.249 --> 00:17:30.685
| wonder if I can... I wonder
if I can become a nurse?

00:17:30.953 --> 00:17:34.048
Of course you can. I'm sure of it.

00:17:34.823 --> 00:17:37.258
You'll be a wonderful nurse.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:41.128
To me, you're already a great nurse.

00:17:42.031 --> 00:17:44.500
Really? Thank you, Makoto.

00:17:47.202 --> 00:17:48.328
You're such a good person.

00:17:48.771 --> 00:17:51.240
Lisa told me... about the frog.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:55.167
You thought I liked them so you
went and caught one, right?

00:17:55.711 --> 00:17:58.089
The day you were admitted, you tried to give...

00:17:58.113 --> 00:18:00.445
...your mom the frying pan
when you shouldn't be moving...

00:18:01.717 --> 00:18:04.743
...and you gave me tea to cheer me up tonight.

00:18:05.387 --> 00:18:08.550
Miss Takano... Miss Takano, I...

00:18:13.395 --> 00:18:15.193
That's right! I'm on the clock!

00:18:17.699 --> 00:18:18.825
Mizuki...

00:18:20.436 --> 00:18:21.995
You'll be out tomorrow.

00:18:22.838 --> 00:18:25.569
| won't be able to come tomorrow,
but you're not a kid anymore, so...

00:18:26.075 --> 00:18:28.669
...you'll be able to make it
home by yourself, right?

00:18:29.511 --> 00:18:30.273
Makoto.

00:18:30.345 --> 00:18:32.439
Tonight's the night.

00:18:37.352 --> 00:18:38.183
Her day off?

00:18:38.887 --> 00:18:40.616
Miss Takano's not here today?

00:18:40.956 --> 00:18:41.616
Yes.

00:18:42.024 --> 00:18:44.493
| see... How about tomorrow?

00:18:44.726 --> 00:18:47.491
Tomorrow? She'll be here tomorrow night.

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:51.261
Night... Then I won't get to...

00:19:02.344 --> 00:19:04.255
You're leaving today.

00:19:04.279 --> 00:19:06.024
What's with that look on your face?

00:19:06.048 --> 00:19:07.413
He's right, Kurumizawa.

00:19:07.783 --> 00:19:08.773
Is there something wrong?

00:19:09.084 --> 00:19:10.677
Too bad, Makoto.

00:19:11.053 --> 00:19:12.612
L-Lisa!

00:19:12.921 --> 00:19:16.289
But, you'll find someone much better!

00:19:16.758 --> 00:19:17.919
So, good luck!

00:19:18.327 --> 00:19:19.158
Thank you.

00:19:19.461 --> 00:19:21.429
Lisa, let's see each other in five years.

00:19:22.264 --> 00:19:24.096
You have no chance with me.

00:19:24.299 --> 00:19:26.233
| like younger guys.

00:19:26.435 --> 00:19:27.960
Oh, I see...

00:19:41.116 --> 00:19:43.278
Mizuki, you came...

00:19:44.052 --> 00:19:46.043
Yeah... I was a little unsure, though.

00:19:46.688 --> 00:19:47.712
Mizuki...

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.858
| want to be a nurse.

00:19:50.659 --> 00:19:53.720
You praised me the other day, but...

00:19:54.096 --> 00:19:56.087
...| don't think I'm there yet.

00:19:56.565 --> 00:19:58.192
I'm nowhere near...

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.235
| thought about giving up, but...

00:20:01.904 --> 00:20:06.307
...because of that night with you,
| wanted to give it one more try.

00:20:07.042 --> 00:20:09.943
| want to be a nurse that patients can count on.

00:20:10.579 --> 00:20:13.947
That's why... That's why love is on hold.

00:20:14.716 --> 00:20:16.275
Otherwise, I might come to depend on you.

00:20:16.852 --> 00:20:18.718
| just wanted to tell you that.

00:20:19.755 --> 00:20:20.847
Mizuki.

00:20:21.256 --> 00:20:23.691
I'm sorry, but thank you.

00:20:30.465 --> 00:20:33.025
Every special memory is
associated with a scent.

00:20:34.236 --> 00:20:36.068
When you are surrounded by that scent...

00:20:36.672 --> 00:20:40.768
...your heart can always return
to that unforgettable moment...

00:20:41.977 --> 00:20:43.376
Congratulations.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.511
Thank you.

00:20:49.051 --> 00:20:53.955
...where the colors of the picture
that you see are forever bright.

00:21:02.464 --> 00:21:04.432
So, you're going to wait for her?

00:21:04.733 --> 00:21:06.462
Of course! As long as it takes.

00:21:07.336 --> 00:21:07.962
Whoa.

00:21:09.605 --> 00:21:10.629
Sorry!

00:21:15.444 --> 00:21:17.412
